Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.99,0:00:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My Obelisk, the Tormentor, has\Neliminated 4,000 of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're only one\Nattack away from defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric, you shall never attain\Nthe power that you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Yugi! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to back that evil freak\Ninto a corner, dude! See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek didn't even know\Nwhat hit him out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a complete daze.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of like you are every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.35,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Marek allow Obelisk\Nto attack him so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems as if Marek\Nwanted this to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be planning to use his face\Ndown card to somehow counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful, my Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's evil side\Nis extremely devious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.51,0:02:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He prefers to prolong his opponent's\Nsuffering for his own amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.39,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Pharaoh is no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.35,0:02:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki's not looking so good, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does he have to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one step away from defeating Marek\Nand winning the Battle City Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But it will take more\Nthan that to keep me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you've forgotten who really\Nsuffers when I lose my points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my weaker side has almost completely\Nlost himself to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to save mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But based on your actions in this\Nduel, I'd say you're destroying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure my other\Nhalf would agree with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,As he slowly slips away thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think that poor soul\Nwas once your loyal servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see he's getting\Nrepaid by his exalted king.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.87,0:03:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to attack us, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So my weak side can\Nsacrifice more of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to protect Merrick's good side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised Ashizu he'd be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but if his evil side prevails,\Nthe whole world will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a way to save\Nthe good, Merrick, and the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And get rid of his evil side for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to figure out how.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.73,0:03:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't you think there's a\Nreason why we've made it this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because we're destined\Nto stop this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you did 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You should feel honored, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:04:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the lives I've destroyed, yours\Nhas been the most amusing to crush,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and the worst is ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm about to reveal will horrify you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,for I have a card that will\Nshock you to your core.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he's planning to use his face-down\Ncard to devastate the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been stringing him\Nalong since this duel began,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fool continues to take my bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon he'll vanish from this world forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.33,0:04:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark side grows stronger\Nas I slip into the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And before I'm gone forever,\NI wanted to say, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done nothing but protect\Nme since the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have repaid you\Nwith anger and disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could take everything\Nback, but now it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil within me is about to prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The very evil I created out of my own\Nhatred now threatens to destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And once he gains the Pharaoh's power,\Nthe entire world will pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You were there the day\Nmy dark side was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The day I received the\NTomb Keeper's initiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a Tomb Keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bodion, stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My life has changed forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're a Tomb Keeper now. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I have to pledge\Nmy life to some pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, I'm forbidden\Nto join this clan, so I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So I performed my own ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this mark proves my\Nloyalty to your family, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always loyal to me, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I betrayed the\NTomb Keepers and abused
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the ancient scriptures for\Nmy own selfish purposes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you never left my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why you stood by me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you knew what\NI was doing was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you were the only one\Nwho could control the evil within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you were hurt,\Nmy wicked side took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's nothing left for me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drifting away while\Nhis power increases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.09,0:06:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to repay\Nyou for all you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be forgetting\Nabout the face-down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,card that you activated\Nwith your last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap with the power\Nto stop an Egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But hell, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Marek has a trap\Ncard powerful enough to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,obelisk it's time for me\Nto unveil my secret weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh by causing me to\Nlose more than half of my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,life points you've allowed\Nme to play this card it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,both a trap and a monster\Nsay hello to metal reflect
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,slime what is that thing\Nit's a creature made of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,plasma giving it the ability\Nto take on the shape of the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.01,0:07:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,monster that just attacked\Nme so my slime monster will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,now morph into the likeness\Nof Obelisk the Tormentor. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the clone of an Egyptian god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, that thing is gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's gonna be\Na big, slimy obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That giant booger's gonna\Nbecome an Egyptian god?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, don't look now,\Nbut I think it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,that's obelisk it's true pharaoh meet my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,egyptian god slime you'll never stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.09,0:08:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick made an exact\Ncopy of Yugi's Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the tormentor does that\Nmean they're equal in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Marix is just a cheap\Ncopy of the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His wannabe obelisk only has 3,000
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,defense points, so the real obelisk\Ncannot get into next week with one blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's gonna destroy that fake next\Ntime he attacks, right, Seto? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's more to Marix's monster
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,than meets the eye, Mukuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your carbon copy pales in\Ncomparison to the original
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,merrick my egyptian god slime\Nis more powerful than you think
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh but you'll find that\Nout soon enough now finish
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.69,0:09:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,your move so my assault can\Ncontinue fine i'll place one card
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.95,0:09:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,face down it's your move very
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,well fool that's the exact card
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,i needed to make my egyptian\Ngod slime unstoppable nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,will be able to destroy it my\Nlife points will be protected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Indefinitely, not even the\Nmighty Obelisk will get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrow, it won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon my winged dragon of Ra will\Nreturn to the field and wipe you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my Egyptian god slime to serve as\Na wall between you and my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for the card that\Nwill make that all possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the Indestructible Revival Jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you recall your\Nlast encounter with my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,revival jam when you faced\Nmy mind slave strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic cylinders, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So your revival jam is able\Nto block all of my attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, then it regenerates, Barrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.97,0:10:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have one more card\Nto play, Polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to fuse my Egyptian\Ngod slime with my revival jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you think Marek\Nis cooking up now, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:11:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the fusion of my\Ntwo creatures is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you my Egyptian god slime has\Ntransformed into a new, more powerful beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move, so go ahead and attack\Nit, if you dare. Very well. Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Big Shield\NGardner in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.63,0:11:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for me to destroy your\NEgyptian god card imposter, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice one, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You liquefied that phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it was indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's fusion monster\Nis regenerating itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because my monster has the combined
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,power of Egyptian God\NSlifer and Revival Jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my invincible defense monster,\Nmy life points can no longer be damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, defeating me is\Nimpossible, Pharaoh. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This was my plan from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And you fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How naive of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about a thing, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh figure out how to\Ntake that big slime ball down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't look too\Npromising from where I'm standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this was all part of\NMarek's strategy all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He let Yugi's Obelisk, the\NTormentor, attack him on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That allowed Marek to create\Nan unstoppable obelisk clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, whenever Yugi attacks it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's Egyptian god slime will absorb\Nthe blow and then regenerate itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.61,0:12:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All you can do at this point is wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,for soon you shall witness the return\Nof the most powerful Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if you could attack me, it's\Nmy weaker half who pays the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to ban him into\Nthe shadows for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so feel free to do that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, he suffered\Nquite a bit already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of his body has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat my dark side at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down, and then\NI summon Bogadian in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A creature with the ability to remove\N300 of your life points each turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,causing you-know-who to suffer. Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:14:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. I promise. How touching. All
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,right my move I shall\Nplace one card face down
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I'll sacrifice my big shield
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.27,0:14:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,gardener in order to\Nsummon dark magician girl
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning her was pointless, Farrow,\Nand you'll understand why soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Magician Girl,\Nattack his Bogadian!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite. Now observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack has triggered my\Nultimate trap card, Jam Defender.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.25,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Jam Defender is in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,my Egyptian God Slime is able to\Nintercept every attack you make!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack backfires!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've successfully executed a strategy\Nthat prevents me from losing this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the beast that stands behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've achieved complete immortality,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and since your Dark Magician\NGirl's attack backfired,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you lose 1,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,your little friend is about to lose even\Nmore of himself to the Shadow Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the special\Nability of my Vulganian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows are feasting on little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose a few more life points and your\Nfriend's body will be completely gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.89,0:16:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All three Egyptian god\Ncards will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Along with all of your power, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, everyone on Earth\Nwill bow down before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can beat this guy, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You must overpower my dark side at all\Ncosts and don't worry about protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're losing your marbles, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have borrowed your friend's\Nbody in order to reason with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy my evil half and let\Nthe shadows take me. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears my weak side\Ndoesn't know when to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, soon he'll be\Nout of my way for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My family and I were charged with\Nprotecting your tomb until your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I always resented this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So he was born as a result of my anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he must be destroyed, and\NI shall go with him. Yo, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, is Teya home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've rejected the Pharaoh\Nfor your entire life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you beg for his forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's a little\Ntoo late for that, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already created me, and\Nnow your body belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.91,0:17:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And you barely exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a mere shadow of\Nthe person you once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me finish what you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She's under Merrick's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But she must be in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth to Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender your own life to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sister, but there\Nisn't another way. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.73,0:18:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You must take down the evil force\Nthat now controls my body, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And if destroying him means\Ndestroying me, then so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.99,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that poetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My weaker self would rather be swallowed\Nby the shadows than see me win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I'm afraid this is\Nall just a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's get back to\Nyour defeat, shall we? My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can bring back Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Ra will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card,\Nmining for magical stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to transfer any\Nmagic card from my graveyard to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And all I have to do is discard two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I've chosen\Nthis card, Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In just one more turn, I'll bring\Nback my Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so, but his Egyptian\NGod card is impossible to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's one chance\Nleft, but it won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That weapon will come ultimate power!
